      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I'm Row-Haan, for Humanitarians AI. This week was one thing: the Midjourney series. Six parts, finished and shipped. But the useful part of this week wasn't the videos. It was discovering that the plan I'd written from research was wrong, and finding that out by actually using the tool.",
