      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "SHIPPED",
      "narration_text": "Here's what shipped. Six parts, nearly nineteen minutes of training material, all of it in four K. Part one gets you your first image. Two is prompt writing. Three is what to do with a result you like. Four is the settings panel. Five is getting the same look twice, and six is the editor and where your files live. Every part passed its own automated beat check before I called it done.",
