        "at": "2026-09-10T23:07:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "KIT",
      "narration_text": "So the correction cost a week and bought something durable. Every screen in those six videos is rebuilt in code: twenty-three new components, all reusable. When Midjourney redesigns their interface, I edit a component instead of re-recording six videos. And the interface spec I wrote while reading those screenshots runs to over eight hundred lines, so the next person doesn't have to guess either.",
